{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXesFKHeh_SCluTFzWJzrCRhtYRWhZLynCIZ9b8Pzf70lmCmhAD0Okx56bzbALvWG9eNi7nT5Dp4ONQIynPtP9vcikV8zFIsw-u4BCQUcYAFLnGnfpoSTz311iZg-m-9dQDAvVOi7A.jpg?t=1742820191\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stormbinders is a turn-based strategy game where magic storms shape the battlefield. The breaking of the magical weave has unleashed chaos, pitting powerful factions against one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who will bring balance back and forge a new destiny for the world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXdgOT8vsokbOQseX7O7nWAQujzgVrbM3KB8dnyX_-knFjIaien-cynxejkCIj8on7hWDUSwkQUShpBEiQsIi99P7og8zHaIMtDm4uJ1qb3bIv2oHHqHtASv1LcF7OtEKTbEIfSbBg.jpg?t=1742820191\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mark your calendars: something special is going to be revealed on March 25th at 4:00 PM CET.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/1.SeasonSwitch.gif?t=1742820191\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Linear single-player campaign</strong> \u2013 Shape the fate of the world through strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique storm system</strong> \u2013 Dynamic weather conditions impact battles and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explorable global map</strong> \u2013 Traverse the land, fight enemies, and gather resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hex-based tactical combat</strong> \u2013 A classic battlefield system with an orthographic camera.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Castle management</strong> \u2013 Construct and upgrade buildings to enhance your realm and army.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse factions and units</strong> \u2013 Combine different types of units and lead powerful armies, each with distinct abilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2134720?t=1742820191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/a4e05f11123504a7b95a7138114cfd194ec3cdf9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742820191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/a3a8b5f0e648411c3bd875eb2f32e5c6b913a869/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742820191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/a3a8b5f0e648411c3bd875eb2f32e5c6b913a869/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742820191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXesFKHeh_SCluTFzWJzrCRhtYRWhZLynCIZ9b8Pzf70lmCmhAD0Okx56bzbALvWG9eNi7nT5Dp4ONQIynPtP9vcikV8zFIsw-u4BCQUcYAFLnGnfpoSTz311iZg-m-9dQDAvVOi7A.jpg?t=1742820191\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stormbinders is a turn-based strategy game where magic storms shape the battlefield. The breaking of the magical weave has unleashed chaos, pitting powerful factions against one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who will bring balance back and forge a new destiny for the world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134720/extras/AD_4nXdgOT8vsokbOQseX7O7nWAQujzgVrbM3KB8dnyX_-knFjIaien-cynxejkCIj8on7hWDUSwkQUShpBEiQsIi99P7og8zHaIMtDm4uJ1qb3bIv2oHHqHtASv1LcF7OtEKTbEIfSbBg.jpg?t=1742820191\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mark your calendars: something special is going to be revealed 